==Description==
'''Bunz''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]] on any map and gamemode. It was obtainable by killing enemies which each had a chance to drop '''Bunz''', though these enemies had no special accessories to indicate that they will drop '''Bunz'''. 

It was used to complete Levels on the [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]]. The amount earned per wave varied based on the gamemode played.

It took the appearance of a pink marshmallow bunny.

